  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "多层环形层级图：内圈大类、外圈子类，扇区按数值占比展开；点击下钻缩放，中心显示当前层级名并带返回，支持键盘切换。",
  "usage": "预算/分类占比、组织层级、文件大小的层级构成，2–3 层、每层 4–7 段。",
  "caution": "超过 3 层或叶子太多会碎成细线，改用可折叠树或矩形树图；极窄扇区在卡片里点不中，要放大到弹窗用。",
  "hint": "点击扇区下钻，点中心返回；←→ 切换同级，Enter 下钻",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【旭日层级图】目标：3 层预算数据（全部 → 5 个大类 → 14 个子类 → 28 个明细）的多层环形图；扇区按占比展开，点击下钻、中心显示当前层级名与返回，Esc 返回。\n\n1) 结构：.panel（卡片 340×156；弹窗 680 宽 × min(640,100%) 高）> .head（标题 + 面包屑）> .stage（position:relative）> svg（hole-hit 圆、rings、labels）+ .center（HTML 覆盖层：层级名、总额、返回按钮）+ .tip。每个树节点预先建一个 path，切层级时只改 d 和 opacity。\n\n2) 环数与几何：视角根（viewRoot）决定环数 = min(2, maxDepth(viewRoot))。根视角 2 环（大类 + 子类）；下钻到大类仍 2 环（子类 + 明细）；下钻到子类 1 环。ringW=(R-hole-(levels-1)×ringGap)/levels；hole 卡片 max(17, R×0.335)、弹窗 max(60, R×0.235)；ringGap 1.4/4；扇区间隙按中半径换算成角度留 1.1px（卡片）/2px（弹窗）。\n\n3) 路径：极坐标 M(r0,a0) → A(r0,r0,large,1,r0,a1) → L(r1,a1) → A(r1,r1,large,0,r1,a0) → Z；角度从 -90° 开始顺时针。**递归时用父节点的总量算子节点角度占比**（用根总量会把外圈压细，这是最容易踩的坑）。\n\n4) 下钻动画：0.35 秒 ease-out。给旧视角和新视角的每个节点建 from/to 几何：消失的节点收成中心一个点、opacity→0；新出现的节点从父节点旧扇区展开、opacity 0→1；逐帧插值 a0/a1/r0/r1/opacity 并重写 d。动画期间禁用点击和悬停。\n\n5) 中心与返回：层级名 8.5px / 弹窗 21px，总额 6.5 / 13px；返回按钮卡片 6.5px、弹窗 40px 高（命中区 ≥44px）。点中心空洞、返回按钮、Esc / Backspace 都返回上一级；面包屑显示「全部 › 研发」。\n\n6) 标签：只在弧长足够时显示（弧长 > 字数×字号×1.04+10 且环厚 > 字号×1.7）；卡片只显示内环，弹窗内外环都显示。文字颜色按色阶取对比色：色阶 ≥55 用 --ui-bg，否则 --ui-text；描边用扇区自己的颜色，保证压在任何底色上都清楚。\n\n7) 颜色：只用 --ui-*。大类色阶 [88,70,54,40,28]，子类 = 大类×0.72，明细 = 大类×(0.38/0.45/0.52 轮换)，fill = color-mix(brand X%, surface)。不要写死 hex。\n\n8) 悬停：pointermove 找 .wedge，tooltip 显示「研发 · 34 万 · 34%」，同时给扇区 brightness(1.08)；pointerleave 隐藏。悬停不改中心文字，避免抢掉「当前层级 + 返回」。\n\n9) 键盘：每个可见扇区 role=\"button\" + aria-label；roving tabindex（同一时刻只有一个 tabindex=0）；←/→ 在可见扇区之间移动焦点，Enter/Space 下钻，Esc/Backspace 返回；focus-visible 加 2px 描边。所有 focus() 带 preventScroll。\n\n10) 自动演示（仅 !window.__uiInteractive）：用 window.__uiDemoCursor() 依次悬停 3 个大类 → 点击下钻 → 停 2 秒 → 点中心返回 → 下一个；一轮结束隐藏光标。prefers-reduced-motion 下直接切视角不做动画，也不跑演示。\n\n11) 坑：① 递归角度占比别用根总量；② 动画期间 currentGeo 还是旧值，别让点击插进来；③ 多个 SVG 的 id 会全局冲突，渐变 / clipPath 的 id 要加前缀（本图不用渐变，但改版时注意）；④ 卡片中心圆很小，返回按钮要缩小，但文字不能小于 6.5px。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{height:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px;overflow:hidden}\n  .panel{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:100%;max-width:340px;height:156px;padding:9px 11px 6px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ui-surface);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-surface));border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);box-shadow:0 8px 22px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent);overflow:hidden}\n  .head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex:0 0 auto;z-index:2}\n  .title{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.2px;white-space:nowrap}\n  .crumb{font-size:8px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .crumb.on{color:var(--ui-brand)}\n  .stage{position:relative;flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;margin-top:1px}\n  svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n  .wedge{stroke:none;pointer-events:all;outline:none;transition:opacity .15s ease,filter .15s ease}\n  .wedge:focus-visible{stroke:var(--ui-text);stroke-width:2;stroke-opacity:.9}\n  .wedge.hov{filter:brightness(1.08)}\n  .hole-hit{fill:transparent;pointer-events:all}\n  .lbl{pointer-events:none;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;paint-order:stroke;stroke-linejoin:round}\n  .center{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;pointer-events:none;z-index:3;transition:opacity .14s ease}\n  .center.fade{opacity:0}\n  .c-name{font-size:8.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:.2px;max-width:52px;white-space:nowrap}\n  .c-meta{font-size:6.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);margin-top:1px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .back{margin-top:2px;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,transparent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent);color:var(--ui-brand);font:inherit;font-size:6.5px;line-height:1.35;cursor:pointer;pointer-events:auto}\n  .back.on{display:inline-flex}\n  .back:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ui-brand);outline-offset:1px}\n  .tip{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;transform:translate(-50%,-130%);padding:3px 7px;border-radius:6px;font-size:8.5px;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--ui-bg);background:var(--ui-text);opacity:0;transition:opacity .12s ease;pointer-events:none;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;z-index:4}\n  .tip.on{opacity:1}\n  .tip b{font-weight:600}\n  @media (min-height:421px){\n    body{padding:24px}\n    .panel{max-width:680px;height:min(640px,100%);padding:18px 22px 14px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 18px 48px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent)}\n    .title{font-size:16px}\n    .crumb{font-size:12px}\n    .stage{margin-top:4px}\n    .c-name{font-size:21px;max-width:150px}\n    .c-meta{font-size:13px;margin-top:3px}\n    .back{font-size:12.5px;padding:0 16px;min-height:40px;margin-top:10px;border-radius:10px}\n    .tip{font-size:11.5px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:8px}\n  }\n  @media (max-height:420px){\n    body{padding:8px}\n    .panel{height:160px}\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n    .center{transition:none}\n    .wedge,.tip{transition:none}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\">\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <span class=\"title\">预算构成</span>\n    <span class=\"crumb\" id=\"crumb\">全部 · 5 个大类</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\">\n    <svg id=\"sun\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"预算构成旭日图：内圈 5 个大类、外圈 14 个子类，点击扇区下钻，按 Esc 返回\">\n      <circle class=\"hole-hit\" id=\"holeHit\" r=\"16\"></circle>\n      <g id=\"rings\"></g>\n      <g id=\"labels\"></g>\n    </svg>\n    <div class=\"center\" id=\"center\">\n      <div class=\"c-name\" id=\"cName\">全部</div>\n      <div class=\"c-meta\" id=\"cMeta\">100 万</div>\n      <button class=\"back\" id=\"back\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"返回上一级\">返回</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip\" id=\"tip\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var NS='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';\n  var svg=document.getElementById('sun'),\n      gRings=document.getElementById('rings'),\n      gLabels=document.getElementById('labels'),\n      stage=document.getElementById('stage'),\n      panel=document.getElementById('panel'),\n      holeHit=document.getElementById('holeHit'),\n      center=document.getElementById('center'),\n      cName=document.getElementById('cName'),\n      cMeta=document.getElementById('cMeta'),\n      backBtn=document.getElementById('back'),\n      crumb=document.getElementById('crumb'),\n      tip=document.getElementById('tip');\n\n  var INTERACTIVE=!!window.__uiInteractive;\n  var REDUCED=false;\n  try{ REDUCED=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches; }catch(e){}\n\n  var RAW={\n    name:'全部',\n    children:[\n      {name:'研发',children:[\n        {name:'前端',children:[{name:'Web',value:8},{name:'移动',value:6}]},\n        {name:'后端',children:[{name:'服务',value:7},{name:'数据',value:5}]},\n        {name:'测试',children:[{name:'自动化',value:5},{name:'手动',value:3}]}\n      ]},\n      {name:'市场',children:[\n        {name:'投放',children:[{name:'搜索',value:6},{name:'信息流',value:5}]},\n        {name:'内容',children:[{name:'文章',value:5},{name:'视频',value:4}]},\n        {name:'活动',children:[{name:'线上',value:4},{name:'线下',value:2}]}\n      ]},\n      {name:'运营',children:[\n        {name:'客服',children:[{name:'工单',value:4},{name:'在线',value:3}]},\n        {name:'社区',children:[{name:'版主',value:3},{name:'话题',value:3}]},\n        {name:'数据',children:[{name:'报表',value:3},{name:'埋点',value:2}]}\n      ]},\n      {name:'设计',children:[\n        {name:'UI',children:[{name:'视觉',value:4},{name:'组件',value:3}]},\n        {name:'UX',children:[{name:'研究',value:3},{name:'原型',value:2}]}\n      ]},\n      {name:'行政',children:[\n        {name:'招聘',children:[{name:'校招',value:2},{name:'社招',value:2}]},\n        {name:'财务',children:[{name:'报销',value:2},{name:'预算',value:1}]},\n        {name:'设施',children:[{name:'办公',value:2},{name:'设备',value:1}]}\n      ]}\n    ]\n  };\n\n  var uid=0, allNodes=[], nodeById={};\n  function buildTree(raw,parent,depth){\n    var n={id:++uid,name:raw.name,parent:parent,depth:depth,children:[],shade:0};\n    nodeById[n.id]=n; allNodes.push(n);\n    if(raw.children){\n      n.children=raw.children.map(function(c){ return buildTree(c,n,depth+1); });\n      n.value=n.children.reduce(function(s,c){ return s+c.value; },0);\n    }else{\n      n.value=raw.value;\n    }\n    return n;\n  }\n  var root=buildTree(RAW,null,0);\n  var catShades=[88,70,54,40,28];\n  root.children.forEach(function(c,i){\n    c.shade=catShades[i];\n    c.children.forEach(function(s){\n      s.shade=Math.round(c.shade*0.72);\n      s.children.forEach(function(it,j){ it.shade=Math.round(c.shade*(0.38+0.07*(j%3))); });\n    });\n  });\n  function fillFor(n){ return 'color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-brand) '+n.shade+'%, var(--ui-surface))'; }\n  function textFor(n){ return n.shade>=55?'var(--ui-bg)':'var(--ui-text)'; }\n\n  /* 每个树节点一个 path，切换层级时只改 d 和 opacity */\n  var paths={};\n  allNodes.forEach(function(n){\n    var p=document.createElementNS(NS,'path');\n    p.setAttribute('class','wedge');\n    p.setAttribute('data-id',n.id);\n    p.setAttribute('tabindex','-1');\n    p.setAttribute('role','button');\n    p.style.fill=fillFor(n);\n    p.style.display='none';\n    gRings.appendChild(p);\n    paths[n.id]=p;\n  });\n\n  var viewRoot=root, currentGeo=new Map(), animating=false;\n  var W=0,H=0,cx=0,cy=0,R=0,hole=16,ringGap=1.5,gapPx=1.2,big=false;\n\n  function measure(){\n    var r=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!r.width||!r.height) return false;\n    W=Math.round(r.width); H=Math.round(r.height);\n    svg.setAttribute('viewBox','0 0 '+W+' '+H);\n    big=window.innerHeight>420;\n    cx=W/2; cy=H/2;\n    R=Math.min(W,H)/2-(big?16:4);\n    hole=big?Math.max(60,R*0.235):Math.max(17,R*0.335);\n    ringGap=big?4:1.4;\n    gapPx=big?2:1.1;\n    holeHit.setAttribute('cx',cx);\n    holeHit.setAttribute('cy',cy);\n    holeHit.setAttribute('r',Math.max(6,hole-2));\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  function maxDepth(n){\n    if(!n.children.length) return 0;\n    var m=0;\n    n.children.forEach(function(c){ var d=1+maxDepth(c); if(d>m) m=d; });\n    return m;\n  }\n\n  function computeGeo(vr){\n    var geo=new Map();\n    var levels=Math.min(2,maxDepth(vr));\n    if(!levels) return geo;\n    var ringW=(R-hole-(levels-1)*ringGap)/levels;\n    (function walk(parent,a0,a1,level){\n      var total=parent.value||1;\n      var acc=a0;\n      parent.children.forEach(function(ch){\n        var span=(a1-a0)*(ch.value/total);\n        var c0=acc,c1=acc+span; acc=c1;\n        var r0=hole+level*(ringW+ringGap), r1=r0+ringW;\n        geo.set(ch.id,{a0:c0,a1:c1,r0:r0,r1:r1,level:level,opacity:1});\n        if(level+1<levels&&ch.children.length) walk(ch,c0,c1,level+1);\n      });\n    })(vr,-Math.PI/2,-Math.PI/2+Math.PI*2,0);\n    return geo;\n  }\n\n  function wedgePath(r0,r1,a0,a1){\n    var mid=(r0+r1)/2;\n    var pad=mid>1?gapPx/mid:0;\n    if(a1-a0<pad*2.2) pad=0;\n    var s0=a0+pad/2,s1=a1-pad/2;\n    if(s1<=s0) return '';\n    function pt(r,a){ return (cx+r*Math.cos(a)).toFixed(2)+','+(cy+r*Math.sin(a)).toFixed(2); }\n    var large=(s1-s0)>Math.PI?1:0;\n    return 'M'+pt(r0,s0)+\n      'A'+r0.toFixed(2)+','+r0.toFixed(2)+' 0 '+large+' 1 '+pt(r0,s1)+\n      'L'+pt(r1,s1)+\n      'A'+r1.toFixed(2)+','+r1.toFixed(2)+' 0 '+large+' 0 '+pt(r1,s0)+'Z';\n  }\n\n  function render(geo){\n    allNodes.forEach(function(n){\n      var p=paths[n.id], g=geo.get(n.id);\n      if(!g){ p.style.display='none'; return; }\n      p.style.display='';\n      p.setAttribute('d',wedgePath(g.r0,g.r1,g.a0,g.a1));\n      p.style.opacity=(g.opacity===undefined?1:g.opacity);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function updateLabels(){\n    while(gLabels.firstChild) gLabels.removeChild(gLabels.firstChild);\n    var fs0=big?14:7.2, fs1=big?11.5:6.6;\n    allNodes.forEach(function(n){\n      var g=currentGeo.get(n.id);\n      if(!g) return;\n      if(!big&&g.level>0) return;\n      if(g.level>1) return;\n      var fs=g.level===0?fs0:fs1;\n      var arc=(g.a1-g.a0)*(g.r0+g.r1)/2;\n      var w=n.name.length*fs*1.04;\n      if(arc<w+10) return;\n      if(g.r1-g.r0<fs*1.7) return;\n      var mid=(g.a0+g.a1)/2, rr=(g.r0+g.r1)/2;\n      var t=document.createElementNS(NS,'text');\n      t.setAttribute('class','lbl');\n      t.setAttribute('x',(cx+Math.cos(mid)*rr).toFixed(2));\n      t.setAttribute('y',(cy+Math.sin(mid)*rr+fs*0.36).toFixed(2));\n      t.setAttribute('text-anchor','middle');\n      t.setAttribute('font-size',fs);\n      t.style.fill=textFor(n);\n      t.style.stroke=fillFor(n);\n      t.style.strokeWidth=(big?2.6:2).toFixed(1);\n      t.textContent=n.name;\n      gLabels.appendChild(t);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function updateCenter(){\n    cName.textContent=viewRoot===root?'全部':viewRoot.name;\n    cMeta.textContent=viewRoot.value+' 万';\n    backBtn.classList.toggle('on',viewRoot!==root);\n    if(viewRoot===root){\n      crumb.textContent='全部 · '+root.children.length+' 个大类';\n    }else{\n      var path=[],p=viewRoot;\n      while(p&&p!==root){ path.unshift(p.name); p=p.parent; }\n      crumb.textContent='全部 › '+path.join(' › ');\n    }\n    crumb.classList.toggle('on',viewRoot!==root);\n  }\n\n  function updateFocus(){\n    var vis=allNodes.filter(function(n){ return currentGeo.has(n.id); });\n    var current=document.activeElement;\n    var hasFocus=vis.some(function(n){ return paths[n.id]===current; });\n    vis.forEach(function(n,i){\n      var p=paths[n.id];\n      var pct=Math.round(n.value/viewRoot.value*100);\n      p.setAttribute('aria-label',n.name+'，'+n.value+' 万，占 '+pct+'%'+(n.children.length?'，按回车下钻':''));\n      p.setAttribute('tabindex',(!hasFocus&&i===0)||paths[n.id]===current?'0':'-1');\n    });\n  }\n\n  function centerPoint(mid,rr){\n    var r=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n    return {x:r.left+cx+Math.cos(mid)*rr, y:r.top+cy+Math.sin(mid)*rr};\n  }\n\n  function showTip(node,pagePt){\n    var g=currentGeo.get(node.id);\n    if(!g) return;\n    var pct=Math.round(node.value/viewRoot.value*100);\n    tip.innerHTML='<b>'+node.name+'</b> · '+node.value+' 万 · '+pct+'%';\n    var sr=stage.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var left=pagePt.x-sr.left, top=pagePt.y-sr.top;\n    tip.style.left=left+'px';\n    tip.style.top=top+'px';\n    tip.classList.add('on');\n    var tw=tip.offsetWidth;\n    left=Math.max(tw/2+4,Math.min(sr.width-tw/2-4,left));\n    tip.style.left=left+'px';\n    paths[node.id].classList.add('hov');\n  }\n  function hideTip(){\n    tip.classList.remove('on');\n    allNodes.forEach(function(n){ paths[n.id].classList.remove('hov'); });\n  }\n\n  function setHover(id){\n    if(animating) return;\n    hideTip();\n    if(id==null) return;\n    var n=nodeById[id];\n    if(!n) return;\n    var g=currentGeo.get(n.id);\n    if(!g) return;\n    var mid=(g.a0+g.a1)/2, rr=(g.r0+g.r1)/2;\n    showTip(n,centerPoint(mid,rr));\n  }\n\n  function applyView(newRoot){\n    viewRoot=newRoot;\n    currentGeo=computeGeo(viewRoot);\n    render(currentGeo);\n    updateLabels();\n    updateCenter();\n    updateFocus();\n    hideTip();\n  }\n\n  function animateTo(newRoot){\n    if(animating||newRoot===viewRoot) return;\n    var to=computeGeo(newRoot);\n    var from=currentGeo;\n    var ids={};\n    from.forEach(function(v,id){ ids[id]=1; });\n    to.forEach(function(v,id){ ids[id]=1; });\n    var list=[];\n    Object.keys(ids).forEach(function(key){\n      var id=+key, n=nodeById[id];\n      var f=from.get(id);\n      if(!f){\n        var anc=n.parent;\n        while(anc&&!from.has(anc.id)) anc=anc.parent;\n        f=anc&&from.has(anc.id)?Object.assign({},from.get(anc.id),{opacity:0}):{a0:-Math.PI/2,a1:-Math.PI/2,r0:0,r1:0,level:0,opacity:0};\n      }\n      var t=to.get(id);\n      if(!t) t={a0:(f.a0+f.a1)/2,a1:(f.a0+f.a1)/2,r0:0,r1:0,level:f.level,opacity:0};\n      list.push({id:id,from:f,to:t});\n      var p=paths[id];\n      p.style.display='';\n    });\n    animating=true;\n    center.classList.add('fade');\n    hideTip();\n    var t0=performance.now(),dur=350;\n    function frame(ts){\n      var t=Math.min(1,(ts-t0)/dur);\n      var e=1-Math.pow(1-t,3);\n      list.forEach(function(it){\n        var f=it.from,g=it.to,p=paths[it.id];\n        var a0=f.a0+(g.a0-f.a0)*e, a1=f.a1+(g.a1-f.a1)*e;\n        var r0=f.r0+(g.r0-f.r0)*e, r1=f.r1+(g.r1-f.r1)*e;\n        var op=f.opacity+(g.opacity-f.opacity)*e;\n        if(op<0.01){ p.style.opacity=0; return; }\n        p.setAttribute('d',wedgePath(r0,r1,a0,a1));\n        p.style.opacity=op;\n      });\n      if(t<1){ requestAnimationFrame(frame); }\n      else{\n        animating=false;\n        applyView(newRoot);\n        center.classList.remove('fade');\n      }\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n  }\n\n  function zoomTo(node){\n    if(!node||!node.children.length) return;\n    if(REDUCED){ applyView(node); return; }\n    animateTo(node);\n  }\n  function zoomUp(){\n    if(viewRoot===root) return;\n    if(REDUCED){ applyView(viewRoot.parent); return; }\n    animateTo(viewRoot.parent);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 交互 ---------- */\n  if(INTERACTIVE){\n    svg.addEventListener('pointermove',function(e){\n      if(animating) return;\n      var p=e.target.closest?e.target.closest('.wedge'):null;\n      if(!p){ hideTip(); return; }\n      var n=nodeById[+p.getAttribute('data-id')];\n      var g=currentGeo.get(n.id);\n      if(!g) return;\n      var pct=Math.round(n.value/viewRoot.value*100);\n      tip.innerHTML='<b>'+n.name+'</b> · '+n.value+' 万 · '+pct+'%';\n      var sr=stage.getBoundingClientRect();\n      tip.style.left=(e.clientX-sr.left)+'px';\n      tip.style.top=(e.clientY-sr.top)+'px';\n      tip.classList.add('on');\n      allNodes.forEach(function(m){ paths[m.id].classList.remove('hov'); });\n      p.classList.add('hov');\n    });\n    svg.addEventListener('pointerleave',hideTip);\n    svg.addEventListener('click',function(e){\n      if(animating) return;\n      var p=e.target.closest?e.target.closest('.wedge'):null;\n      if(!p) return;\n      zoomTo(nodeById[+p.getAttribute('data-id')]);\n    });\n    holeHit.addEventListener('click',function(e){ e.preventDefault(); zoomUp(); });\n    backBtn.addEventListener('click',function(e){ e.preventDefault(); zoomUp(); });\n    svg.addEventListener('focusin',function(e){\n      var p=e.target.closest?e.target.closest('.wedge'):null;\n      if(!p) return;\n      setHover(+p.getAttribute('data-id'));\n    });\n    svg.addEventListener('focusout',function(e){\n      if(!animating) hideTip();\n    });\n    svg.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\n      if(animating) return;\n      var vis=allNodes.filter(function(n){ return currentGeo.has(n.id); });\n      if(!vis.length) return;\n      var cur=vis.findIndex(function(n){ return paths[n.id]===document.activeElement; });\n      if(e.key==='ArrowRight'||e.key==='ArrowDown'){\n        e.preventDefault();\n        var ni=cur<0?0:(cur+1)%vis.length;\n        paths[vis[ni].id].focus({preventScroll:true});\n      }else if(e.key==='ArrowLeft'||e.key==='ArrowUp'){\n        e.preventDefault();\n        var pi=cur<0?0:(cur-1+vis.length)%vis.length;\n        paths[vis[pi].id].focus({preventScroll:true});\n      }else if(e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' '){\n        if(cur>=0){\n          e.preventDefault();\n          zoomTo(vis[cur]);\n        }\n      }else if(e.key==='Backspace'||e.key==='Escape'){\n        e.preventDefault();\n        zoomUp();\n      }\n    });\n    window.addEventListener('resize',function(){\n      if(animating) return;\n      if(!measure()) return;\n      applyView(viewRoot);\n    });\n    if(window.ResizeObserver){\n      var rs=0;\n      try{\n        new ResizeObserver(function(){\n          clearTimeout(rs);\n          rs=setTimeout(function(){\n            if(animating) return;\n            if(!measure()) return;\n            applyView(viewRoot);\n          },160);\n        }).observe(panel);\n      }catch(err){}\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 自动演示：悬停 → 下钻 → 返回，循环三个大类 ---------- */\n  var demoTimers=[];\n  function after(ms,fn){ var t=setTimeout(fn,ms); demoTimers.push(t); return t; }\n  function clearDemo(){ demoTimers.forEach(clearTimeout); demoTimers=[]; }\n  function runDemo(){\n    if(INTERACTIVE||REDUCED) return;\n    clearDemo();\n    if(viewRoot!==root) applyView(root);\n    var cats=root.children.slice(0,3), idx=0;\n    var cursor=window.__uiDemoCursor?window.__uiDemoCursor():null;\n    function round(){\n      if(INTERACTIVE) return;\n      if(idx>=cats.length){ idx=0; if(cursor) cursor.hide(); after(1100,round); return; }\n      var cat=cats[idx++];\n      var g=currentGeo.get(cat.id);\n      if(!g){ after(600,round); return; }\n      var mid=(g.a0+g.a1)/2, rr=(g.r0+g.r1)/2;\n      var pt=centerPoint(mid,rr);\n      if(cursor) cursor.at(pt.x,pt.y);\n      showTip(cat,pt);\n      after(700,function(){\n        if(INTERACTIVE) return;\n        if(cursor) cursor.press();\n        after(160,function(){\n          if(INTERACTIVE) return;\n          if(cursor) cursor.release();\n          hideTip();\n          if(cursor) cursor.hide();\n          zoomTo(cat);\n          after(2000,function(){\n            if(INTERACTIVE) return;\n            var br=backBtn.getBoundingClientRect();\n            if(cursor) cursor.at(br.left+br.width/2,br.top+br.height/2);\n            after(650,function(){\n              if(INTERACTIVE) return;\n              if(cursor) cursor.press();\n              after(160,function(){\n                if(INTERACTIVE) return;\n                if(cursor) cursor.release();\n                zoomUp();\n                after(1100,round);\n              });\n            });\n          });\n        });\n      });\n    }\n    after(700,round);\n  }\n\n  function boot(){\n    if(!measure()){ setTimeout(boot,200); return; }\n    applyView(root);\n    if(!INTERACTIVE) runDemo();\n  }\n  boot();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
